111477892_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MN7B0HuARLsQ7kNvwF_hW9N&_nc_oc=Ado8-zAALivSGficj0hBdq0m26iRBLLcc_8VuBeVM0RUU40SGIHkkFyoDDyXTgb_iNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYtJctW9j-6XtNYB59EfRVIm1666V0NrI1cwHm2Y3lzg&oe=6AFC6E51"}, {"file_name": "screenshotS4.png", "id": "1072031171820897", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_1072031175154230_5224736725401338602_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bhV8D9FFGOwQ7kNvwFz56kK&_nc_oc=AdpCpa3DgGW7WYhRRmMy6PfLwi3O2iAifpL_fMmycRGDa1tnKJyu0tZcoYmWAXaSMSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQfjhJziJCqgsCsKQsrD0WhmLPW6fwsamVEPFzR-OLQIg&oe=6AFC76B0"}, {"file_name": "screenshotS5.png", "id": "1698998441202359", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1698998444535692_5538952509263218216_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rpEaJZSfoc0Q7kNvwEOSJb-&_nc_oc=AdoOusJR3lLw4FBduKp3g6wK2UJUIguVJVLAwXTXTNKUnGvihPP19H2RxJnAA_WVTPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMXyKGmQpUJp1UdfbpG4WIGYZkELEZs8vO2xYnS8aXng&oe=6AFC7141"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Focus Flow VR: Meditation & Mindfulness", "keywords": ["meditation", "mindfulness", "focus", "calm", "breathing"], "long_description": "Focus Flow VR: Meditation & Mindfulness\n\nFocus Flow VR is a calm and immersive VR breathing experience designed to help you pause, slow down, and reconnect with your focus.\n\nEnter a peaceful virtual environment with a glowing breathing ring, soft ambient music, gentle voice guidance, floating particles, and a lotus that blooms with your breath. Follow the inhale and exhale rhythm, watch the environment respond, and complete short calming sessions at your own pace.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Guided inhale and exhale breathing sessions\n\u2022 Peaceful nature-inspired VR environment\n\u2022 Glowing breathing ring that expands and shrinks with each breath\n\u2022 Blooming lotus visual feedback\n\u2022 Soft music and gentle voice prompts\n\u2022 Session timer and breathing count summary\n\u2022 Simple seated or standing experience\n\u2022 Designed for short relaxation breaks\n\nFocus Flow VR is made for users who want a quiet, lightweight VR space for mindful breathing, focus breaks, and peaceful moments.\n\nFocus Flow VR is a wellness and relaxation experience. It is not a medical device and is not intended to provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.", "short_description": "Step into a peaceful VR space and follow gentle breathing guidance with calming visuals, a glowing breathing ring, soft music, and a blooming lotus. Focus Flow VR helps you slow down, relax, and enjoy a simple mindful breathing session inside a quiet virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jessvrworks.site/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://jessvrworks.site/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Jessvrworks", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://jessvrworks.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "977167555215373"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2